<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/glossary#old-turkic">Glossary</a> · Term</p><h1 class="enc-title">Old Turkic</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Old Turkic is the earliest recorded Turkic language, written in a runic script from the 8th century. Its best-known texts are the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/orkhon-inscriptions">Orkhon inscriptions</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bilge-qaghan">Bilge Qaghan</a> and Kul Tegin of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/second-turkic-khaganate">Second Turkic Khaganate</a>, while the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yenisei-kyrgyz">Yenisei Kyrgyz</a> left many inscribed stelae along the Yenisei. The texts also name neighbouring peoples such as the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tatars">Tatars</a>.</p></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>It may come from <b>Old Turkic</b> words for “daybreak” or “dawn”, or, as Stefan Georg has proposed, from a Proto-Yeniseian word for “high”.</blockquote><a href="/religion/tengrism">Tengrism · Origins</a></li><li><blockquote>Mongolian has drawn words from many languages: first from <b>Old Turkic</b>, Sanskrit (often through Uyghur), Persian, Tibetan, Tungusic and Chinese, later from Russian, English and Mandarin.</blockquote><a href="/language/mongolian">Mongolian · Legacy</a></li><li><blockquote>Their memorial stelae on the Orkhon River, written in the <b>Old Turkic</b> runic script, proclaim the duties of the khagan and warn the Turks against Chinese luxury.</blockquote><a href="/state/second-turkic-khaganate">Second Turkic Khaganate</a></li><li><blockquote>Tatars appear in <b>Old Turkic</b> inscriptions of the 8th century as the Otuz Tatar and Toquz Tatar.</blockquote><a href="/state/tatar-confederation">Tatar confederation</a></li><li><blockquote>The Kyrgyz combined herding, farming and iron working, and left many stelae in the <b>Old Turkic</b> runic script along the Yenisei.</blockquote><a href="/state/yenisei-kyrgyz-khaganate">Yenisei Kyrgyz Khaganate</a></li></ul></section>
